> On Tue, Aug 07, 2018 at 10:35:42AM -0700, Dave Hansen wrote:
>> On 08/07/2018 10:17 AM, kan.liang@linux.intel.com wrote:
>>> Denverton and Gemini Lake are platform names and should not be used for
